As a [[Seeker]], Casterwill's elder daughter served as the first [[Lady of the Lake]] and forged the powerful [[Willblade]]. She and her siblings helped [[Lord Casterwill]] fight the [[Nullifiers]]. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}}

She was the first to be bonded with [[Quetzalcoatl]], whose [[Ring]] she placed within the Willblade. She later delivered the Willblade to her father so that he could seal the [[Spiral Mark]] with the sword. {{source|The Spiral Mark}}

On the longest night of the year, she and her siblings fought [[the Betrayer]] at the [[Spiral Mark]], stopping him reactivating the mark and using [[Void]] to call back the Nullifiers. {{source|Chasing Void}}

She eventually laid the [[Willblade]] to rest, sealed in a stone on [[Avalon]], where it was found by [[Lok Lambert]]. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}} Her [[Titan]], [[Quetzalcoatl]], was sealed in the [[Pyramid of the Sun]], and used as a signal to call together the scattered [[Casterwill family]] many years later. {{Source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}} It was eventually recovered by [[Lok Lambert]] and returned to its original place in the Willblade. {{source|Dante's Return}}
